#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.rst:2
msgid "pyvista\\_js.UnstructuredGrid"
msgstr "pyvista\\_js.UnstructuredGrid"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid:1
msgid "Unstructured grid dataset."
msgstr "非構造格子データセット。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid:3
msgid ""
"An unstructured grid can hold cells of arbitrary type (tetrahedra, "
"hexahedra, wedges, pyramids, triangles, quads, etc.).  This class mirrors "
"the :class:`pyvista.UnstructuredGrid` constructor API."
msgstr ""
"非構造格子は任意のタイプのセル (四面体、六面体、くさび形、角錐、三角形、四角形など) を保持できます。このクラスは "
":class:`pyvista.UnstructuredGrid` のコンストラクタ API と同様です。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid:7
msgid ""
"For rendering in vtk.js the 3-D cells are decomposed into their surface "
"faces so that they can be displayed as polygonal geometry."
msgstr "vtk.js での描画のため、3D セルはその表面の面に分解され、多角形ジオメトリとして表示されます。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid:10
msgid ""
"Cell connectivity in VTK format: ``[n_pts0, p0, p1, ..., n_pts1, p0, p1, "
"...]``."
msgstr "VTK 形式のセル接続情報: ``[n_pts0, p0, p1, ..., n_pts1, p0, p1, ...]``。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid:13
msgid ""
"Array of VTK cell type constants (see :class:`CellType`) - one value per "
"cell."
msgstr "VTK セルタイプ定数の配列 (:class:`CellType` を参照)。セルごとに 1 つの値。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid:16
