#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.bounding_sphere:3
msgid ""
"Uses Ritter's algorithm to approximate the minimum bounding sphere. Returns "
"NaN values if there are no points."
msgstr "Ritter のアルゴリズムを使用して最小バウンディングスフィアを近似します。点が存在しない場合は NaN を返します。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.rst:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.bounding_sphere:6
msgid ""
"Sphere radius as a float and center as a tuple of floats ``(x, y, z)``."
msgstr "球の半径は float、中心は float のタプル ``(x, y, z)``。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.rst:0
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.n_cells:3
msgid "Number of cells in the grid."
msgstr "格子内のセルの数。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.n_points:3
msgid "Number of points in the grid."
msgstr "格子内の点の数。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.plot:3
msgid ""
"This is a convenience method that creates a :class:`~pyvista_js.Plotter`, "
"adds this grid, and calls :func:`~pyvista_js.Plotter.show`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~pyvista_js.Plotter` を作成し、この格子を追加して :func:`~pyvista_js.Plotter.show`"
" を呼び出す便利なメソッドです。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.plot:6
msgid "Color of the mesh."
msgstr "メッシュの色。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.plot:8
msgid "Opacity, between 0 and 1. Default is 1."
msgstr "不透明度。0 から 1 の間。デフォルトは 1 です。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.plot:10
msgid "Enable physically based rendering. Default is False."
msgstr "物理ベースレンダリングを有効にします。デフォルトは False です。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.plot:12
msgid "Metallic factor for PBR. Default is 0.0."
msgstr "PBR の金属度。デフォルトは 0.0 です。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.plot:14
msgid "Roughness factor for PBR. Default is 0.5."
msgstr "PBR の粗さ。デフォルトは 0.5 です。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.UnstructuredGrid.point_data:3
msgid "Dict-like container for point data arrays."
msgstr "点データ配列の辞書風コンテナ。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.to_scene_data:3
msgid ""
"The 3-D cells are decomposed into their surface polygons so that they can be"
" rendered as a ``\"mesh\"`` source in vtk.js."
msgstr "3D セルはその表面ポリゴンに分解され、vtk.js で ``\"mesh\"`` ソースとして描画されます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.mesh.UnstructuredGrid.to_scene_data:6
msgid "Source configuration with ``\"type\": \"mesh\"``."
msgstr "``\"type\": \"mesh\"`` を持つソース設定。"
